age\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blaise_Hhune\" title=\"Blaise Hhune\">Blaise Hhune</a> – A werewolf in <a href=\"/wiki/Szarr_Palace\" title=\"Szarr Palace\">Szarr Palace</a></li>\n<li>Fridrik Hhune – An Upper City resident mentioned in the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bloodstained_Parchment\" title=\"Bloodstained Parchment\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Book_Note_B_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_B_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Book_Note_B_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_B_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Book_Note_B_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Note_B_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Book_Note_B_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_B_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/Book_Note_B_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bloodstained_Parchment\" title=\"Bloodstained Parchment\">Bloodstained Parchment</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gheris_Hhune\" title=\"Gheris Hhune\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/be/Portrait_Gheris_Hhune.png/30px-Portrait_Gheris_Hhune.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/be/Portrait_Gheris_Hhune.png/45px-Portrait_Gheris_Hhune.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/be/Portrait_Gheris_Hhune.png/60px-Portrait_Gheris_Hhune.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gheris Hhune\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/be/Portrait_Gheris_Hhune.png/30px-Portrait_Gheris_Hhune.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/be/Portrait_Gheris_Hhune.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"